    "description": {
      "value": "This green spellbook with gold trim contains a cautionary story about a boy who was eaten by a wolf after he previously lied about wolf attacks.\n\nWhen opened, the engravings on the front seem to move in a loop, enacting this story.\n\n- **Activate:** Reaction\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n- **Trigger:** A creature succeeds, but doesn't critically succeed, at a Perception check to disbelieve an illusion spell you prepared from this grimoire\n\nYou quickly tell a fib to try to smooth over the inconsistencies in your illusion. Attempt a Deception check against the triggering creature's Perception DC. If you succeed, the creature doesn't disbelieve the illusion."
